   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "n6",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Basket purchase\nsplit by fair value · s18–19\nsolid on WHY (land not depreciated, different lives, revaluation by class)\n⚠ method right, slipped equipment (30k, should be 36k): always check the split adds to the price (ghost card)\nsolid: entry (Dr land/building/equipment, Cr cash); knows there's no 'discount' entry",
