   "text": "Issue shares for it ✓\nFV of the shares ON THE DATE · s22\nDr asset / Cr share capital (par) / Cr share premium (rest)\n⚠ first used par (100k), 'the price moves': cost is locked on the day (ghost card)\nsolid after: own words 'lock in on the date, only revaluation changes it' (fix: COST not worth; par = label)",
